  "definition": "Schematic stored-raster apertures; all enrolled group members. Clear: minimum detail >=0.30; smooth: minimum detail in [0.05,0.30). Both need >=96px, range>=0.10 and code-tail fractions<0.20. Engineering demonstration selected using three source-only development probes, not human recommendations.",
